sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Op as Оператор
    participant REST as Floodlight REST / UI
    participant ACL as ACL module
    participant S1 as s1 (edge h1)
    participant FL as Forwarding
    participant H1 as h1
    participant H4 as h4
    Op->>REST: POST /wm/acl/rules/json<br/>{src-ip 10.0.0.1/32, dst-ip 10.0.0.4/32, nw-proto ICMP, action DENY}
    REST->>ACL: добавить правило
    ACL->>S1: FLOW_MOD ADD priority=30000, idle=0, hard=0,<br/>match icmp,nw_src=10.0.0.1,nw_dst=10.0.0.4, без действий
    Note over S1: dump-flows: priority=30000 ... actions=drop
    H1->>S1: ICMP echo 10.0.0.1 -> 10.0.0.4
    S1-->>S1: совпадение prio 30000 -> drop (n_packets++)
    Note over S1,FL: PACKET_IN нет -> контроллер не участвует
    H4->>S1: ICMP echo 10.0.0.4 -> 10.0.0.1 (через s4..s2)
    S1->>FL: PACKET_IN (table-miss)
    FL->>S1: FLOW_MOD priority 1 на s1..s4, PACKET_OUT
    S1->>H1: echo request доставлен
    H1->>S1: echo reply 10.0.0.1 -> 10.0.0.4
    S1-->>S1: совпадение prio 30000 -> drop
    Note over H1,H4: итог pingall: 16% dropped (10/12),<br/>недоступны только пары h1-h4 и h4-h1
